  "details": "ruoyi-ai 3.0.0 through 3.1.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the GET /workflow/search endpoint that exposes other users' private workflows. Authenticated non-admin users can query this endpoint, which lacks owner or is_public filtering, to list enabled private workflows in the same tenant, including UUIDs and full node and edge configurations.",
